# an unknown option is reported as the filter left it
program Folded
arg --NOPE
status 2
output
Error: Unknown option --nope
folded [options] [add [options]] arguments...

  -s <arg>, --string <arg>
      Call callback on string argument.
  -i <arg>, --integer <arg>
      Call callback on integer argument.
  -a
      Option with short name only.
  --long-name
      Option with long name only.

add [options] items...  Add items.

  -n <arg>, --name <arg>
      Call callback on name argument.
